== Icelandic ==
===Etymology===
From ''[[fjörutíu]]'' meaning "[[forty]]" + ''[[og]]'' "[[and]]" + ''[[sjö]]'' "[[seven]]". Meaning '''forty and seven'''.
=== Cardinal number ===
'''fjörutíu og sjö''' {{indecl}}

# [[forty-seven]], cardinal number after [[fjörutíu og sex]] and before [[fjörutíu og átta]]

